    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this exceptionally spacious four-bedroom, five-bathroom apartment, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Brunswick Court development in the heart of Stoneybatter.\r\n\r\nOffering generous proportions, excellent natural light and a versatile layout, this impressive apartment presents an excellent opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors seeking a substantial property in one of Dublin’s most popular areas.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of four generously proportioned bedrooms, each with its own en-suite bathroom, a separate study, a large entrance hallway and an impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The living space benefits from a striking curved section of the building with extensive glazing, creating a bright and distinctive room with excellent natural light.\r\n\r\nThe separate study provides valuable flexibility for those working from home, while the generous hallway and well-proportioned bedrooms make this a particularly spacious apartment.\r\n\r\nThe property would make an excellent city home or investment opportunity, with its combination of substantial accommodation, four en-suite bedrooms and superb Stoneybatter location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room / Kitchen - 5.31m (17'5\") x 3.91m (12'10\")\r\nContemporary open-plan space with curved wall of windows, fitted white units, ample dining and seating area, and access to balcony-style glazing, creating a bright social hub.\r\n\r\nStudy - 4.2m (13'9\") x 3.47m (11'5\")\r\nFlexible room ideal as home office or guest space, with large window, fitted carpet and neutral décor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.23m (13'11\") x 4.21m (13'10\")\r\nGenerous double room with fitted carpet, large window, space for wardrobe and direct access to en-suite.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (Bedroom 1) - 1.98m (6'6\") x 1.97m (6'6\")\r\nPrivate shower room with tiled finishes, WC and wash basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.23m (13'11\") x 3.11m (10'2\")\r\nWell-proportioned double bedroom with modern finishes and good natural light.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (Bedroom 2) - 1.71m (5'7\") x 1.66m (5'5\")\r\nCompact shower room serving Bedroom 2, with WC and basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 5.07m (16'8\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\r\nLarge double bedroom with space for desk and storage, ideal for sharers.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (Bedroom 3) - 1.72m (5'8\") x 1.42m (4'8\")\r\nTiled shower room with WC and basin, accessed directly from Bedroom 3.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.8m (12'6\") x 3.34m (10'11\")\r\nBright double bedroom with glazed door to outside space and plenty of room for wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (Bedroom 4) - 1.6m (5'3\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\r\nModern en-suite shower room with WC and basin.\r\n\r\nHallway - 4.73m (15'6\") x 8.51m (27'11\")\r\nWide entrance hall with fitted carpet, contemporary lighting and access to all rooms, providing excellent circulation space.\r\n\r\nHot Press\r\nUseful storage and hot water cylinder cupboard off the hallway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptionally spacious first floor apartment\r\nFour bedrooms\r\nBright open-plan living/kitchen\r\nSeparate study/home office\r\nExcellent natural light\r\nVibrant Stoneybatter location\r\nClose to Red LUAS line\r\nTwo Juliette balconies\r\nGas central heating\r\nClose to Smithfield and Dublin City Centre"
      },
      {
